[h2]Build 0.9.102[/h2]
[h3]Changed[/h3]
[list]
[*][b]Skittles and bowling pins stand up from every side.[/b] Seen from either end of the lane the pins used to be circles viewed from straight above, while from the side they were standing pins. They now stand upright in all four directions, and topple the same way when the ball arrives.
[*][b]Cornhole board is the right depth side-on.[/b] Facing east or west the board's top was squashed to about half the width it has from the ends. It is now drawn at its proper depth with a round hole, and the sacks land across the whole board to match.
[/list]
[list]
[*]No gameplay changes. Safe to update mid-save.
[/list]
